<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24372" root="صعو" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْوٌ</span></b>  <i>A small</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُصْفُور</span> [or <i>bird of the sparrowkind</i>], (K, TA,) <i>red in the head;</i> (TA;) fem.
with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>: (K:) or <i>small</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصَافِير</span> [or <i>birds of the
sparrow-kind</i>], <i>the heads of which are red;</i> n. un.
with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>: (Msb:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْوَةٌ</span> signifies <i>a certain bird;</i>
and its pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْوٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِعَآءٌ</span>: (S:) or the pl. (of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْوَةٌ</span>, Msb) is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِعَآءٌ</span> (Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعَوَاتٌ</span>, (K, in
the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صعْواتٌ</span>,) and the pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْوٌ</span> is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْعَآءٌ</span>:
some say that <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْوٌ</span> is originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَصْعٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Hence, (TA,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ صَعْوَةٌ</span> <i>A she-camel small in the
head.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And the pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْعَآءٌ</span> signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُصُولٌ</span>
[pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْلٌ</span>, q. v.]. (TA.)

